# - Cryptographically Signed Manifest: `runs/<run_id>/manifest.json` with `test_evaluated: true`  
#
# > **CRITICAL EVALUATION & LOCKED PROTOCOL INVARIANTS (G6, A13.1, A13.2, A13.3):**  
# > - **A13.1 Cryptographic Hash Guard:** All pipeline configurations are verified against frozen SHA-256 hashes before execution begins.  
# > - **A13.2 One-Time Execution Invariant:** The unseen test partition ($D_{\text{test}}$, Days 25–30) is evaluated strictly once. Re-tuning after seeing test set results is strictly forbidden.  
# > - **A13.3 Model & Threshold Freezing:** All champion models and detection thresholds are frozen from Phase 12. Zero parameter search or calibration occurs on $D_{\text{test}}$.  
# > - **Non-Causal Association:** All operational attribution is framed as probabilistic evidence ("likely associated causes"), avoiding false causal claims.

